<title>POLAND: Polish shares end lower in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares end lower in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six stocks fell, one rose and two were flat in Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Turnover was at 2.6 million zlotys.</p>
<p>Six stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>NFI units fell 3.3 percent in a 13.3-million- zloty turnover.</p>
<p>WSECONT. -- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
